{"id":"3433138437743ec7e98deb0c","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/01/trump-iowa-rally","published_at":"2026-11-02T00:16:25Z","collected_at":"2026-11-02T00:38:50.495016Z","title":"Trump launches racist diatribe against Abdul El-Sayed at Iowa rally","text":"Donald Trump speaks at a rally in Dubuque, Iowa, on 1 November 2026. Photograph: Andrew Harnik/Getty Images View image in fullscreen Donald Trump speaks at a rally in Dubuque, Iowa, on 1 November 2026. Photograph: Andrew Harnik/Getty Images Donald Trump Trump launches racist diatribe against Abdul El-Sayed at Iowa rally President again took aim at progressive Senate candidate and lauded Haley Stevens for endorsing Mike Rogers Roque Planas Sun 1 Nov 2026 19.16 EST Last modified on Sun 1 Nov 2026 19.18 EST Share Prefer the Guardian on Google Donald Trump railed against Democratic US senate hopeful Abdul El-Sayed at a campaign event in Iowa Sunday, repeatedly referring to the Michigan progressive as a “jihadist”. Trump’s comments aimed to influence a neck-and-neck race that will play an outsized role in determining which party controls the senate after Tuesday’s midterm elections. The president bashed El-Sayed, a practicing Muslim, in brazenly racist terms, saying that Congress would have to “get a special metal detector for Abdul” if he were elected. “If you vote for this jihadist lunatic that wants to destroy you, you’re crazy,” Trump said. What are the races to watch in the US midt","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/bd7c662bbdcb7022f36caae8cd4aa1f30f919f2e/0_0_5096_3398/master/5096.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none"],"author":"Roque Planas","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"44b505e71c6b04b674185ef71ec571975c6b5fcb77c1e9a6c92889937bb43e5c","original_text_chars":3070,"original_html_chars":16097,"text_truncated":true,"media_count":1,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/01/trump-iowa-rally","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/01/trump-iowa-rally"}}}
{"id":"6c52c0dab6b8d2c5c3e05ade","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/01/abdul-el-sayed-haley-stevens-michigan-senate","published_at":"2026-11-02T00:12:17Z","collected_at":"2026-11-02T00:38:51.204823Z","title":"Democrat Haley Stevens endorses Abdul El-Sayed’s Republican rival Mike Rogers","text":"Mike Rogers, the Michigan Republican Senate candidate, with Haley Stevens, a Michigan Democratic representative, attend a church service on Sunday. Photograph: Jose Juarez/AP View image in fullscreen Mike Rogers, the Michigan Republican Senate candidate, with Haley Stevens, a Michigan Democratic representative, attend a church service on Sunday. Photograph: Jose Juarez/AP Michigan Democrat Haley Stevens endorses Abdul El-Sayed’s Republican rival Mike Rogers Endorsement was met with backlash from the party, condemning Stevens for her ‘betrayal’ Chris Hippensteel and Marina Dunbar Sun 1 Nov 2026 19.12 EST First published on Sun 1 Nov 2026 12.47 EST Share Prefer the Guardian on Google Congresswoman Haley Stevens, who lost the Michigan Democratic Senate primary to Abdul El-Sayed, endorsed his Republican rival, Mike Rogers, in an extraordinary rebuke of her party’s nominee on the eve of the midterm elections. Her endorsement came in a video posted to X after she attended an event with Rogers at the predominantly Black Perfecting church in Detroit on Sunday. Stevens’s endorsement was the culmination of an escalating feud between the former primary rivals – primarily over support for Isra","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/b74ef59dc193fbb01caa37d843c2625eeb29b433/111_0_2177_1741/master/2177.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none"],"author":"Chris Hippensteel and Marina Dunbar","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"f850f7c022e2143fbb0b0cd577efac3240337f098b4f473